Chapter: Passes
  cites Codex chapter Lowering (fold-constants-in-chapter, inline-cost-based-in-chapter, inline-leaf-calls-in-chapter, inline-single-caller-in-chapter)
  cites Codex chapter IRCheck (ir-check)
